  "bodyHash": "83e4b7968db6fcf5",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Open Together</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓相鄰放置的相同門、陷阱門和圍欄門能作為一組同時開啟。只需打開其中一個方塊，相連的鄰近方塊就會自動跟隨，讓雙扇門和更寬敞的入口操作起來更加自然。🚪</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組在保留原版行為與建築風格的前提下，消除了日常遊玩中重複點擊的繁瑣。它支援手動互動，且在安裝於伺服器時也能支援紅石等原版機制。⚡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">與大多數類似方案不同，此模組可安裝於客戶端、伺服器或兩者皆可。伺服器安裝能為所有玩家提供最完整且一致的體驗。僅安裝於客戶端也能在有其他玩家的伺服器上使用，但僅限於您自己的手動互動，無法觸發紅石等伺服器端效果。🌐</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚪 雙扇門：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">同時開啟相鄰的同類門，讓入口更流暢、建築更整潔。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪤 雙扇陷阱門：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">連結的陷阱門會同步開關，方便使用地板暗門與裝飾性建築。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚧 雙扇圍欄門：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">相鄰的圍欄門可作為單一門扇開啟，非常適合較寬的道路、農場與動物圍欄。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ 紅石支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">安裝於伺服器端時，支援的方塊可透過紅石等原版互動方式同步開啟。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌐 靈活安裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">適用於客戶端、伺服器或兩者，伺服器安裝能提供最完整的多人遊戲體驗。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👤 僅限客戶端多人遊戲使用：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">即使伺服器未安裝此模組，仍可在您開啟附近相同方塊時提供協助。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 可自訂行為：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可針對每種支援的方塊類型啟用或停用群組開啟功能，並根據個人喜好調整運作方式。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏷️ 整合模組方塊支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可透過方塊標籤（Block Tags）將相容的整合模組門、陷阱門與圍欄門納入支援範圍。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⌨️ 快速切換：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提供可選的快捷鍵，用於暫時啟用或停用群組開啟功能。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器安裝皆為選配</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 與 NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（FABRIC 版需先安裝由 Prospector 開發的 Mod Menu）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有模組都會提供全部類型的設定檔，甚至可能完全不提供。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/natural-waters\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/naturalwaters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hovering-hotbar\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoveringhotbar/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
